 "rationale": "The whole GF(2^4) product is bilinear: with all other Toffolis set to identity, the CNOTs g6-g8 act on zero registers, so the final T15 element alone writes the outputs. It builds them from the 9 two-level Karatsuba AND products, each done as a 4-T Gidney AND on one reused ancilla, CNOT fan-out to q8-q11, then measurement uncompute, for 36 T total. Products and output maps were derived from the reduced polynomial coefficients (F8=d0+d4, F9=d1+d4+d5, F10=d2+d5+d6, F11=d3+d6) and spot-checked by hand on two basis inputs."
